I'm not sure if I understand your problem correctly. But if you are
waiting for another batch, then the other batch should call "send()",
not an independent process every fixed amount of time. You already
have a branch where a batch with attribute<70 follows a sub-trajectory
in which it waits. Why not adding a second sub-trajectory (for the
rest of the batches, where attribute>=70) with a call to "send()"?

