> >
> > Just to confirm, the first call of the wayback ("slave") trajectory has to
> > be called from the time at(0), therefore I will always start the simulation
> > with the capacity+1, correct?
> Correct. You may write a more complicated helper function to replace
> at() and avoid this "problem" at the beginning, or you can simply
> define capacity=9 if you need 10. :)
> > It is working! Thank you very much!
> Perfect!
